  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Environment Economics Programme of Southeast Asia shall bring the results from their climate change vulnerability report to the local level, developing tools for local governments to make vulnerability assessments and design adpatation measures.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Environment Economics Programme of Southeast Asia skall baserat p&#xe5; en tidigare s&#xe5;rbarhetsanlys f&#xf6;r klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar i Asian g&#xe5; vidare med en f&#xf6;rdjupad analys p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5;. Man &#xe4;mnar utveckla konkreta verktyg f&#xf6;r lokala myndigheter att g&#xf6;ra s&#xe5;rbarhetsanalyser och utveckla lokal anpassningar.</narrative>
  </description>
